  "primary": "A projectile flies in an arc where you look and strikes the first target. Effects:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ lightning + 1.25 ❤ earth (lightning ×2 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Soaked for 8 s and leaves a puddle\n• Light push\n• Charge 35: weakness, stuns for 1 s at 65 charge (×2 on wet)\n• Then the lightning jumps onward: up to 4 targets in a row, jumps up to 4 blocks, 1.25 ❤ and 40 charge each (×2 damage and longer jumps on wet, ×1.5 range in puddles)\n• Breaks up to 3 blocks within 0.5 blocks (twice as many if brittle)\n• Rooted in place for 2 s\n• Withering: −0.5 ❤ per second for 4 s\n• Life drain: 0.5 ❤ damage, you heal 0.2 ❤",
